OpenOrca Dataset https://huggingface.co/datasets/Open-Orca/OpenOrca Paper: Orca: Progressive Learning from Complex Explanation Traces of GPT-4 https://arxiv.org/abs/2306.02707 The OpenOrca dataset is a collection of augmented FLAN Collection data. FLAN = Fine-tuned LAnguage Net - a Google's collection of more than 60K common tasks for LLM. https://arxiv.org/abs/2301.13688 Currently 1M GPT-4 completions, and ~3.2M GPT-3.5 completions. It is tabularized in alignment with the distributions presented in the ORCA paper. OpenOrca Dataset from datasets import load_dataset aa = load_dataset( "parquet", data_files="1M-GPT4-Augmented.parquet") print(aa['train']) Dataset({ features:['id','system_prompt','question','response'], num_rows: 994896 }) print(aa['train'][0]) { 'id': 'niv.242684', 'system_prompt': '', 'question': "You will be given a definition of a task first, then some input of the task.
This task is about using the ....
Output:", 'response': '[
  ["AFC Ajax (amateurs)", "has ground", "Sportpark De Toekomst"],
  ["Ajax Youth Academy", "plays at", "Sportpark De Toekomst"]
]'}
